"\n"
"API GitHub\n"
"==========\n"
"\n"
"GitHub client for ``integration.service``.\n"
"\n"
"* REST v3: repositories, branches, commits, webhooks, issues, pull requests, reviews\n"
"* GraphQL v4 through ``graphql_query``\n"
"\n"
"Owns no models. ``github`` is a seed ``integration.service`` record and\n"
