#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_partner_relationship_blocklist
msgid ""
"\n"
"Blocklist proximity\n"
"===================\n"
"\n"
"``l10n_mx_partner_blocklist`` marks a contact that is itself on the SAT 69-B\n"
"definitive list. A listed taxpayer reappearing as a relative's company is\n"
"invisible to that check, which is the shape the problem usually takes.\n"
"\n"
"This bridge walks ``partner_relationship``'s graph and reports which listed\n"
"contacts a contact is connected to, how, and how strongly, on the partner form\n"
"and through ``_get_blocklisted_relatives()``.\n"
"\n"
"**It flags. It does not refuse.** ``l10n_mx_partner_blocklist`` still refuses a\n"
"CFDI only for a partner listed in its own right. Extending a refusal to relatives\n"
"is a compliance judgement about *partes relacionadas* that belongs to whoever\n"
"owns that policy, not to this module.\n"
msgstr ""

